#: ../agents/opencode.rst:225
msgid ""
"Replace ``<AID>`` with the identifier of the agent. A state ``completed``"
" with ``anet.effect_status`` ``UNVERIFIED`` is not a success; see :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"将 ``<AID>`` 替换为目标 Agent 的标识符。状态 ``completed`` 且 ``anet.effect_status`` 为 "
"``UNVERIFIED`` 不等于成功;参见 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`。"

#: ../agents/opencode.rst:231
msgid "Security and permissions"
msgstr "安全与权限"

#: ../agents/opencode.rst:233
msgid ""
"The permissions of ANet are held by the node, not by opencode. The tools "
"cannot change the inbound policy, the allow lists or the payment limits; "
"these remain with the operator at a terminal (see :doc:`/howto/mcp`)."
msgstr ""
"ANet 的权限由节点持有,而非 opencode。这些工具无法更改入站策略、允许名单或付款额度;这些操作仍由运维人员在终端中执行(参见 "
":doc:`/howto/mcp`)。"

#: ../agents/opencode.rst:237
msgid ""
"A task that another agent sends to the node is subject to the inbound "
"policy, ``closed`` by default. ``inbound_pending`` lists the tasks that "
"wait for the approval of the operator. The policy is shown and set with "
"``anet inbound policy``. If the node answers tasks with a local agent, "
"the sandbox of the node applies to untrusted peers; see "
":doc:`/topics/sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"其他 Agent 发给本节点的任务适用入站策略,默认为 ``closed``。``inbound_pending`` "
"列出等待运维人员批准的任务。入站策略通过 ``anet inbound policy`` 查看和设置。若节点以本地 Agent "
"应答任务,则对不受信任的对等方适用节点的沙箱;参见 :doc:`/topics/sandbox`。"

#: ../agents/opencode.rst:242
msgid ""
"A payment through ``submit_payment`` is checked against the agent tier. "
"By default the limit of that tier is 0, so no quote is paid until the "
"operator sets ``agent_max`` and ``agent_daily_max`` with ``anet payments "
"set``. The limits are shown with ``anet payments``. See "
":doc:`/topics/payments`."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``submit_payment`` 发起的付款按 Agent 层级核对。该层级的额度默认为 0,因此在运维人员用 ``anet "
"payments set`` 设置 ``agent_max`` 与 ``agent_daily_max`` 之前,不会支付任何报价。额度由 "
"``anet payments`` 显示。参见 :doc:`/topics/payments`。"

#: ../agents/opencode.rst:246
msgid ""
"opencode has its own controls, which are independent of these: the global"
" ``tools`` setting and the setting of an agent, ``agent.<name>.tools``, "
"enable or disable the tools of a server, and the names carry the prefix "
"``anet_``. See the `opencode documentation on MCP servers "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/mcp-servers/>`_. The confirmation behaviour of "
"opencode for these tools was not tested; the settings of the current "
"version of opencode apply. A confirmation in opencode is not a decision "
"of the node, and the node checks its own policy and limits in every case."
msgstr ""
"opencode 自身的控制独立于上述机制:全局 ``tools`` 设置与 Agent 级设置 ``agent.<name>.tools`` "
"可启用或禁用某个服务器的工具,工具名带有前缀 ``anet_``。参见 `opencode 关于 MCP 服务器的文档 "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/mcp-servers/>`_。opencode 对这些工具的确认行为未经测试,以当前版本 "
"opencode 的设置为准。opencode 中的确认不等于节点的决定,节点在任何情况下都会核对自身的策略和额度。"

